UR  - https://www.cio.com/article/222421/what-is-enterprise-architecture-a-framework-for-transformation.html
AB  - A feature article exploring enterprise architecture (EA) as a strategic framework for transformation. It defines EA as the practice of analyzing, designing, planning, and implementing enterprise analysis to align IT projects and policies with business strategies, enabling organizations to stay agile, resilient, and ahead of digital trends while integrating legacy systems and managing transformation challenges.
